      "rationale": "This is general scientific knowledge not explicitly stated in the provided PubMed context."
    },
    {
      "claim": "Atorvastatin reduces intracellular cholesterol levels, triggering the upregulation of LDL receptors on hepatocytes to increase the clearance of circulating LDL-cholesterol.",
      "verdict": "UNVERIFIABLE",
